# Required. Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-key-here

# Optional overrides (OpenRouter model IDs). Defaults are shown.
# MODEL_DEFAULT=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5
# MODEL_DEEP=anthropic/claude-opus-5.5
# Used only by `npm run evals`
# MODEL_JUDGE=anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5
# API server port. If you change it, also change the proxy target in vite.config.ts.
# PORT=3001
